caption: Backlash
technology-rule: backlash

Backlash represents a harmful condition caused by the chem.

For chems, Backlash normally begins when the beneficial effect ends.

An automatic Backlash has a limitation equal to the corresponding Affliction enhancement. A resistible Backlash is worth half as much.

A resistible Backlash requires an HT roll when the chem ends. On a failure, the condition lasts for minutes equal to the margin of failure, or seconds for Stunning.

Examples include:

Attribute penalties

Nausea

Pain

Daze

Stunning

Unconsciousness

Other Affliction conditions approved by the GM

All effects in an integrated chem suffer the same Backlash.
